{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39959","headline":"新葺茆堂 一 · 徐夤","name":"新葺茆堂 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翦竹诛茆就水滨，静中还得保天真。\n只闻神鬼害盈满，不见古今争贱贫。\n树影便爲廊庑屋，草香权当绮罗茵。\n堦前一片泓澄水，借与汀禽活紫鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}